---
import { SITE_NAME, BUSINESS_CONTACT_EMAIL } from "@/lib/site";
---

<article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:py-16">
  <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-muted">Legal</p>
  <h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-4xl font-bold text-ink">Privacy policy</h1>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-faint">Updated August 2026</p>

  <div class="prose-tokens mt-8 max-w-prose space-y-8">
    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-ink">What we collect</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
        Browsing {SITE_NAME} requires no account. We collect information you choose to give us —
        for example when you email us, submit a quote request, claim a listing, or leave a
        review — such as your name, contact details, and the content of your message. Our
        hosting provider records standard technical logs (IP address, browser type, pages
        requested) to run and secure the service.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-ink">How quote requests are shared</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
        When you submit a quote request, it is shared with the local businesses you select — or,
        where the form says so, with up to three matching local providers — so they can contact
        you about your project by the methods you consent to on the form. We record the consent
        text you agreed to and when you agreed. We do not sell consumer contact information to
        anyone else.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Analytics and cookies</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
        We use privacy-respecting analytics to understand which pages are useful. Where a
        consent banner is shown, analytics load only after you accept. We do not use
        third-party advertising trackers.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Business listing data</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
        Listings contain business information — names, addresses, phone numbers, license
        records — gathered from the businesses themselves and from official public registries.
        If a listing shows your business information and you want it corrected, email us and
        we'll re-verify it against the source.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Your choices</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
        You can ask us what personal information we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or
        ask us to delete it, subject to records we're required to keep (such as consent logs).
        New Jersey, New York, and Pennsylvania residents may have additional rights under state
        law; we honor them regardless of which state you're in.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Contact</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
        Privacy questions and requests:
        <a href={`mailto:${BUSINESS_CONTACT_EMAIL}`} class="font-medium text-brand underline underline-offset-2">{BUSINESS_CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</article>
